          "heading": false
        }
      ],
      "extract": "This specification describes the publication of Global Digital Health Certification Network (GDHCN) key material as Decentralized Identifier (DID) documents. DIDs are specified by the W3C DID Core Specification. The DID concept summarizes the core drivers and usage of the DID format in scope of GDHCN. A key to real interoperability among existing trust networks is to find alignment on trust list formats. Version;",
      "extractCut": true,
      "blocks": [
