        }
      ],
      "extract": "Version 2.0.0 introduces two variants of the trust lists - embedded and by reference. <img src=\"did-trustlist-types.png\" alt=\"Types of DID trustlists\" style=\"width:300px; float:none; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\"/> For each of development (DEV), user-acceptence testing (UAT) and production (PROD) environments there is a trust list according to the following table: Environment; Variant; URL DEV; Embedded;",
      "extractCut": true,
